<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $43-3/8 (FIM 196.87).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $43-3/8 (FIM 196.87).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed up $0-1/4 at $43-3/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 196.87 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia closed up 2.00 markka at 196.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed unchanged at $32-3/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.47 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.20 markka at 73.40.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was again untraded in New York. Its last close was flat at $21 on Wednesday last week. Rauma fell 1.00 markka to 93.50 in Helsinki on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
